from pathlib import Path
import json,shutil,hashlib
local=Path(__file__).parent;src=local/'capri_metasim_01';root=Path(r'E:\pranav\Final sem\sourcefree_synth');dst=root/'runs/capri_metasim_01'
assert json.loads((src/'status.json').read_text())['stage']=='complete'
results=json.loads((src/'results.json').read_text());assert len(results)==5
shutil.copy2(local/'capri_metasim_trial.py',src/'trial_snapshot.py');shutil.copy2(local/'CAPRI_METASIM_PLAN.md',src/'PLAN.md')
dino=Path(r'C:\Users\pranav\.cache\torch\hub\facebookresearch_dino_main');(src/'dino_source').mkdir()
for name in ['vision_transformer.py','LICENSE']:
 shutil.copy2(dino/name,src/'dino_source'/name)
report='# CAPRI Meta-Sim-inspired trial results\n\nExploratory12step per-family adaptation, not full Meta-Sim reproduction. Existing seed731 hybrid frozen; no VLM or real labels. Source paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.11621 .\n\n| Family | DINO MMD reduction | Independent CV before | CV after | DINO delta95% bootstrap interval |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n'
for f,r in results.items():report+=f"| {f} | {100*r['relative_mmd_reduction']:.2f}% | {r['cv_before']:.3f} | {r['cv_after']:.3f} | {r['paired_bootstrap_delta_ci95']} |\n"
report+='\nLower is better for both distances. Bootstrap interval pertains to this chosen adapter and sampled data, not training-seed uncertainty. DINO is also the fitting objective, so improvements there are not independent quality evidence.\n\n480 reference images total:48fit/16selection/32report per family, historically exposed. No report recipes feed generation. Font selection had prior broad exposure, hence no pristine holdout claim.64fresh paired generations/family=640saved images. All final glyph identity/geometry/RGB assertions and renderer visibility checks passed; see per-family fallback counters. Fonts, text length, palette, gradient, glyph layout were immutable.\n\nFinite-difference plateaus remain: integer widths/counts or absent primitive effects can produce zero gradients. Twelve steps/one adapter seed is a bounded pilot, not exhaustive optimization. This does not measure PARSeq transfer or OCR utility. Do not promote automatically.\n'
report+='\n## Assistant visual review\n\nAll five deterministic first-six galleries inspected. Darkbay shows more rectangular clutter and fewer dots, but some new lines/blocks still do not resemble the target layout. Courier has fewer dots and more lines, with major font, stroke and spacing mismatch remaining. City changes are small and do not reproduce thick stepped bands. Outlined removes some noise but does not fix outlined glyphs. CryptBB adds some blocks/reduces clutter; independentCV worsens and the DINO bootstrap interval includes zero. Mixed limited evidence, not an overall visual pass.\n\nTwo Darkbay final candidates failed visibility checks and returned unchanged baselines; remaining families had zero final fallbacks. These are not hidden successes. No OCR validation conducted.\n'
(src/'RESULTS.md').write_text(report)
manifest={str(p.relative_to(src)).replace('\\','/'):hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest() for p in src.rglob('*') if p.is_file()};(src/'INTEGRITY.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,indent=2))
shutil.copytree(src,dst);shutil.copy2(src/'RESULTS.md',root/'docs/CAPRI_METASIM_RESULTS.md');shutil.copy2(src/'PLAN.md',root/'docs/CAPRI_METASIM_PLAN.md')
note='\n\nCAPRI Meta-Sim-inspired trial finished; runs/capri_metasim_01 and docs/CAPRI_METASIM_RESULTS.md. Five independent residual MLP adapters, frozenDINO GaussianMMD and finite-difference renderer gradients, immutable fonts/text/colours/layout;64paired report generations/family. Twelve steps, no classifier training or runtimeVLM. Historical development subsets, not unseen validation. No base CAPRI promotion/modification. See results and visual review; DINO-only improvement insufficient.\n'
for name in ['STYLE_DECISIONS.md','STYLE_HANDOFF.md']:
 with (root/'docs'/name).open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:f.write(note)
with (root/'docs/THESIS_PAPERS.md').open('a',encoding='utf8') as f:
 f.write('\n\n## Meta-Sim — directly used in CAPRI optional pilot\n\nKar et al., ICCV2019, https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.11621 . Read primary preprint sections3.1–3.2.3. Borrowed mutable attribute transformation, identity start, Gaussian featureMMD and finite-difference renderer gradients. Implementation runs/capri_metasim_01/trial_snapshot.py; full protocol docs/CAPRI_METASIM_PLAN.md. Deviations: residualMLP rather than GCN, frozenDINO rather than Inception, zero-init rather than autoencoder pretraining, no downstream task loss or REINFORCE. Not full reproduction. Separate adapter per family, real unlabeled fit allowed only for this optional stage. Results including negative independentCV outcomes: docs/CAPRI_METASIM_RESULTS.md. No novelty attribution for these borrowed ideas.\n\nDINO (Caron et al., ICCV2021, https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.14294 ): reused cached official ViT-S/8 frozenCLS as representation only, no attention or VLM. Weight hash in protocol; source/LICENSE snapshot in run. It is not a validated CAPTCHA similarity measure.\n')
shutil.copy2(src/'status.json',root/'monitor/capri_metasim_status.json');print(dst)

